     "text": "Misuse by malicious actors is a risk with any powerful technology; but in the case of AI, the consequences could be catastrophic.\n\nVery interesting analysis by @scasper.bsky.social on how AI developers' decisions can influence cyber, bio, and chemical terrorism risks."
    },
