       "langs": [
        "en"
       ],
       "text": "🚨New paper (possibly the most important one I have written yet).\n\nWe think that as early as 2027 or 2028, there might be a major AI-enabled terrorism event. We conducted a pre-mortem, made 9 falsifiable predictions, and wrote 2 concrete scenarios.\n\nLed by @kamachee.bsky.social"
      },
